This repository reuses released research code, datasets and model checkpoints.
docs/REUSE.md lists each one with its source and license. The main ones are the
BODHI prompt wrapper (https://github.com/sebasmos/bodhi-llms), the OpenAI
HealthBench evaluation sets, and the base and grader model checkpoints. Each
checkpoint keeps its own license; MedGemma uses the Health AI Developer
Foundations terms. The submitted MedGemma-27B adapters were trained with
Google's tunix and qwix. The added base models were trained with Hugging Face
transformers, peft and trl.
